 ("ul", ["Fossil fuels are limited and will run out if used at present rates.", "Burning gives **smoke and carbon dioxide**, causing air pollution.", "Conserve by **walking or cycling short distances**, using **public transport**, sharing vehicles; use electric vehicles, which emit no smoke, and other alternate energy sources."]),
 ("h2", "11.7 Natural Resources: Renewable and Non-renewable"),
